  "description": "Are you looking for a higher-end Urban model with hydraulic disc brakes and a dedicated 1x drive-train? From quick trips to local stores, to daily commutes to work, and all that urban life requires in between, the brand new Beasley 27.5\" DLX delivers with an even more sophisticated feel for amazing rides in any urban environment. Features include new Shimano Deore 1x components that make shifting sharp with a wider capacity 10-speed cassette, Kenda Kwick 2.0 tires and Shimano hydraulic disc brakes, which ensure short braking distances in all weather conditions. In stark contrast to the regular Beasley 27.5, the DLX version features a shiny brush polished finish that makes it stand out as it should...\nHaro Beasley 27.5\" X6 series, tapered head tube\nInternal FSA Threadless tapered headset\nRigid 27.5\" 6000 Series tapered alloy fork\nNew 2-pc Aluminum crankset w/ 38T Narrow-Wide chainring\nNew Deore M5120 10-spd rear derailleur\nNew Deore M4100 10-spd right shifter\nNew Deore M4100 10-spd 11-46T cassette\nMX-21 Aluminum double wall rims, 27mm wide\nShimano RM35 cassette 32h hubs\nKenda Kwick Seven.5 27.5x2.0\" tires\nShimano MT201 hydraulic brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
